{"results":[{"url":"https://welovetrump.com/2020/10/24/bombshell-report-delaware-gop-senate-candidate-says-sen-chris-coons-daughter-is-on-hunters-laptop/","final_url":"https://welovetrump.com/2020/10/24/bombshell-report-delaware-gop-senate-candidate-says-sen-chris-coons-daughter-is-on-hunters-laptop/","title":"BOMBSHELL REPORT: Delaware GOP Senate Candidate Says Sen. Chris Coons’ Daughter Is ‘On Hunter’s Laptop’","description":"Do You Want A Free 1oz 99.9% Pure Silver Trump Coin? This might be the final nail in the coffin.  According to a new report from GOP Senate Candidate Lauren Witzke, she claims a source has told her they've seen the Hunter Biden laptop and it has Sen. Chris Coons' daughter on it. Who is...","language":"en","text":"by\n\nnoah\n6 years ago6 years ago\n\n72.1k views\n\n72,028 views\n\n* 1.4Kshares\n* Share\n* Tweet\n* GAB\n* Telegram\n* Email\n* Print\n\nThis might be the final nail in the coffin.\n\nAccording to a new report from GOP Senate Candidate Lauren Witzke, she claims a source has told her they've seen the Hunter Biden laptop and it has Sen. Chris Coons' daughter on it.\n\nWho is Chris Coons' daughter you might ask?\n\nYou might not know the name, but we've all seen this famous (or is that infamous?) photo:\n\n## \n\nFrom an ABC article written in 2015, here's what ABC had to say at the time.\n\nEven back then, they knew this was creepy and felt wrong:\n\n## \n\nHere are the breaking details:\n\n## \n\n> BIG BREAKING NEWS:  \n>   \n> \"Sources close to and with deep knowledge of the investigation, have informed me that Chris Coons' DAUGHTER in addition to seven other underage girls are also featured on [Hunter Biden's] laptop.\" pic.twitter.com/rKWlUd7ep9\n>\n> — Lauren Witzke (@LaurenWitzkeDE) October 24, 2020\n\n## \n\n> Chris Coons is most famous for a meme of letting Joe Biden sniff his daughter. He’s been a legislative failure and sold America out at every turn. It’s high time to end his corrupt, globalist agenda. Donate to this campaign today so we can oust him! https://t.co/STg6caQnT0 pic.twitter.com/0fGjcZk0zR\n>\n> — Lauren Witzke (@LaurenWitzkeDE) October 24, 2020\n\n## \n\n> BREAKING: Reports are coming out that pictures of Chris Coons daughter has been found on Hunter Biden's laptop. Just to remind you, this is Chris Coons daughter: https://t.co/vlQ7xJTvlC pic.twitter.com/PHqdJkezES\n>\n> — Ardent Intel (@ArdentIntel) October 24, 2020\n\n## \n\n> The underage girl famous for being seen in public resisting Biden’s creepy advances is 'Featured on Hunter's Laptop' https://t.co/5vh8j5fXc8\n>\n> — TMB Survivor of Danger ™ (@renderfish) October 24, 2020\n\nWe will continue to monitor the story here at WeLoveTrump!\n\nCheck back for more updates.\n\n* 1.4Kshares\n* Share\n* Tweet\n* GAB\n* Telegram\n* Email\n* Print\n\n  \n\n---\n\nstory\n\n## Join the conversation!\n\nPlease share your thoughts about this article below. We value your opinions, and would love to see you add to the discussion!","author":"noah","published_date":"2020-10-25T01:39:28+00:00","latency_ms":922.3102500000095,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}